---
// The pre-1.0 notice, on every page.
---

<div class="gneiss-banner" data-pagefind-ignore>
	<strong>Gneiss is pre-1.0 and subject to change.</strong> Its colors, names and ports may change before 1.0. The <a href="https://github.com/gneiss-theme/gneiss/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">changelog</a> lists every color change.
</div>

<style>
	.gneiss-banner {
		padding: 0.5rem var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gneiss3);
		background-color: var(--gneiss1);
		color: var(--gneiss4);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
		text-align: center;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	strong {
		color: var(--gneiss6);
	}
	a {
		color: var(--gneiss8);
	}
</style>
